1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:05,268
When the ghost ship Mary Celeste was towed into Gibraltar, one official was sure of it.

2
00:00:05,488 --> 00:00:06,084
Murder.

3
00:00:06,584 --> 00:00:14,304
Attorney General Frederick Solly-Flood said the crew got drunk on the cargo, killed the captain and his family, and escaped.

4
00:00:14,804 --> 00:00:15,750
His evidence?

5
00:00:15,970 --> 00:00:18,554
Stains on a sword, and marks on the ship's bow.

6
00:00:19,954 --> 00:00:21,431
Then the tests came back.

7
00:00:21,651 --> 00:00:23,194
The stains were not blood.

8
00:00:23,414 --> 00:00:24,986
The marks were natural wear.

9
00:00:25,486 --> 00:00:27,906
And the cargo was industrial alcohol.

10
00:00:28,127 --> 00:00:30,330
Drinking it would have been a terrible party.

11
00:00:31,730 --> 00:00:34,038
The ten people aboard were never found.

12
00:00:34,258 --> 00:00:37,491
Follow for the real records behind famous mysteries.
